{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>API.Plugin</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"elpi","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Elpi","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"API","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Plugin","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>A plugin of a package <code>pkg</code> must register with <code>register ~name:pkg</code> A plugin can be registered at any time: linked statically, or loaded on demand by <code>Setup.packages.load</code> when the accumulate is met.</p><p>A plugin loaded after <code>Setup.init</code> cannot declare state components nor quotations: such a plugin must be loaded before <code>Setup.init</code>.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-register\"><a href=\"#val-register\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> register : <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../BuiltIn/index.html#type-declaration\">BuiltIn.declaration</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Setup/index.html#type-builtins\">Setup.builtins</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_registered\"><a href=\"#val-is_registered\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_registered : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-builtins\"><a href=\"#val-builtins\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> builtins : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Setup/index.html#type-builtins\">Setup.builtins</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>the builtins of a registered plugin, e.g. to give them to <code>Setup.init</code>; raises an <a href=\"../Error/index.html#extension-ElpiError\"><code>Error.ElpiError</code></a> if it is not registered</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-ensure_registered\"><a href=\"#val-ensure_registered\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> ensure_registered : <span><span class=\"label\">load</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"label\">pkg</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div>"}